      "text": "לָא נָגַע! וְדִילְמָא לְעוֹלָם אֵימָא לָךְ: לָא צְרִיךְ",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לְשַׁקּוֹעֵיהּ, וְקָפָא מֵרֵיחָא מָיֵית. אֶלָּא לְמָה לִי",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "נְטִילַת יָדַיִם — דִּילְמָא מְשַׁקְּעוּ לֵיהּ. <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וְאָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Pappa, fifth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2518\" data-full-name=\"Rav Pappa\" data-name-he=\"רב פפא\">רַב פָּפָּא</span>:",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לָא נִישַׁהֵי אִינִישׁ מָרוֹר בַּחֲרוֹסֶת, דִּילְמָא אַגַּב",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "חַלְיֵיהּ דְּתַבְלִין מְבַטֵּיל לֵיהּ לִמְרוֹרֵיהּ, וּבָעֵינַן",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "טַעַם מָרוֹר, וְלֵיכָּא. אַדְבְּרֵיהּ <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Ḥisda, third-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"1345\" data-full-name=\"Rav Ḥisda\" data-name-he=\"רב חסדא\">רַב חִסְדָּא</span> <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Mar/Rabbana Ukva I, second-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2423\" data-full-name=\"Mar/Rabbana Ukva I\" data-name-he=\"מר עוקבא\" data-crossline-group=\"name-ref-crossline-60430\">לְרַבָּנָא</span>",
      "segment_ids": [
