      "width": "380px",
      "text": "לְדַעְתֵּיהּ וּנְגַע. <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"513\" data-sentence-id=\"5\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"5\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rava, fourth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2582\" data-full-name=\"Rava\" data-name-he=\"רָבָא\">רָבָא</span>: בָּלַע מַצָּה — יָצָא, בָּלַע מָרוֹר —",
