      "width": "380px",
      "text": "מַצָּה נָמֵי לֹא יָצָא. <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"514\" data-sentence-id=\"6\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"ב\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"6\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>אָמַר <span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-amora\" data-sage-type=\"amora\" title=\"Rav Shimi bar Abaye, fifth-generation Amora\" data-authority-id=\"2735\" data-full-name=\"Rav Shimi bar Abaye\" data-name-he=\"רב שימי בר אשי\">רַב שִׁימִי בַּר אָשֵׁי</span>:",
